00:21:05,743 --> 00:21:06,900
What?

271
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:10,035
Are you sure you are not mistaken?

272
00:21:10,035 --> 00:21:12,024
If so, you cannot have a child
with Type B blood.

273
00:21:15,227 --> 00:21:17,771
Test your blood type again, please.

274
00:21:17,771 --> 00:21:20,758
Why do we have to test blood types again?

275
00:21:42,036 --> 00:21:44,514
Thank you for waiting. I have the results.

276
00:21:44,514 --> 00:21:48,445
It shows that your blood type is O,
and yours is, too.

277
00:21:49,227 --> 00:21:52,227
So, if both of our blood types are O,

278
00:21:52,227 --> 00:21:54,332
our child cannot have Type B blood?

279
00:21:54,332 --> 00:21:55,543
Yes, that is right.

280
00:21:57,028 --> 00:21:59,036
Are there any exceptions?

281
00:21:59,036 --> 00:22:01,787
That is impossible.

282
00:22:01,787 --> 00:22:03,021
Honey.

283
00:22:12,722 --> 00:22:14,196
What is going on?

284
00:22:14,196 --> 00:22:16,254
Did something happen to Eun Seo?

285
00:22:19,003 --> 00:22:21,455
No, nothing happened. Don't worry.

286
00:22:22,989 --> 00:22:24,039
Let's wait.

287
00:23:05,129 --> 00:23:06,155
Honey,

288
00:23:08,083 --> 00:23:09,294
do say something.

289
00:23:10,458 --> 00:23:12,442
I should not have come home.

290
00:23:12,442 --> 00:23:14,968
I need to be there when Eun Seo wakes up.

291
00:23:14,968 --> 00:23:17,043
I should go back.

292
00:23:17,043 --> 00:23:20,969
You or Jun Seo can bring her clothes.

293
00:23:20,969 --> 00:23:22,498
Talk with me.

294
00:23:22,498 --> 00:23:25,476
About what?
There is nothing to talk about.

295
00:23:26,945 --> 00:23:28,093
The blood type.

296
00:23:30,235 --> 00:23:31,576
Our blood types.

297
00:23:32,821 --> 00:23:35,863
You and I, we both have Type O blood.

298
00:23:37,148 --> 00:23:38,840
So what?

299
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:40,706
Don't you know your blood type?

300
00:23:42,272 --> 00:23:45,519
Honey, Eun Seo's blood type is B.

301
00:23:45,519 --> 00:23:48,864
So, what about it?

302
00:23:48,864 --> 00:23:50,543
What is the matter with that?

303
00:23:50,543 --> 00:23:51,810
Eun Seo...

304
00:23:52,857 --> 00:23:55,418
Eun Seo might not be our daughter.

305
00:24:00,361 --> 00:24:01,690
No.

306
00:24:08,822 --> 00:24:09,927
Yoon Eun Seo.

307
00:24:11,304 --> 00:24:13,704
Looking at you being on a bed like this,

308
00:24:14,508 --> 00:24:17,362
I am scared you might not wake up.

309
00:24:21,270 --> 00:24:22,561
Did it hurt a lot?

310
00:24:23,743 --> 00:24:25,337
I am sorry I hurt you.

311
00:24:26,318 --> 00:24:27,928
I am so sorry.

312
00:24:28,909 --> 00:24:31,201
I absolve you from your sins.

313
00:24:33,685 --> 00:24:34,685
Yoon Eun Seo.

314
00:24:37,302 --> 00:24:39,590
You were going to apologize
while I was asleep,

315
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:41,631
and never apologize again,
isn't that right?

316
00:24:41,631 --> 00:24:42,913
How did you know?

317
00:24:45,024 --> 00:24:47,231
Were Mom and Dad startled a lot?

318
00:24:47,231 --> 00:24:48,742
Of course.

319
00:24:48,742 --> 00:24:51,937
Mom went home to pick up your clothes.
She will be back tomorrow morning.

320
00:24:53,734 --> 00:24:55,350
What about you?

321
00:24:55,350 --> 00:24:56,985
I couldn't leave you alone.

322
00:24:56,985 --> 00:24:59,841
No, I mean, are you startled, too?

323
00:25:00,376 --> 00:25:01,401
No.

324
00:25:02,471 --> 00:25:04,538
You are mean. I am disappointed in you.

325
00:25:05,735 --> 00:25:07,643
I thought my heart had stopped.

326
00:25:08,686 --> 00:25:10,478
I absolve you from your sins.

327
00:25:10,478 --> 00:25:12,096
Are you really?

328
00:25:12,406 --> 00:25:13,443
It hurts.

329
00:25:14,087 --> 00:25:16,247
- Did it hurt?
- I will tell mom about it.

330
00:25:16,247 --> 00:25:17,453
I am not talking to you.

331
00:25:23,041 --> 00:25:24,467
I have been thinking.

332
00:25:26,562 --> 00:25:31,619
If our child has been switched
at the hospital,

333
00:25:32,698 --> 00:25:35,491
Eun Seo is my daughter.

334
00:25:37,010 --> 00:25:39,672
Something is wrong. It has to be.

335
00:25:39,672 --> 00:25:41,656
My Eun Seo is my daughter.

336
00:25:43,785 --> 00:25:44,891
What if she is not?

337
00:25:47,346 --> 00:25:51,716
What if there is another daughter?

338
00:25:54,833 --> 00:25:55,869
Honey.

339
00:25:57,617 --> 00:26:00,553
I don't know anything at all.

340
00:26:00,553 --> 00:26:01,553
I don't want to hear anything.

341
00:26:01,553 --> 00:26:04,857
I'm not going to listen to what you say.

342
00:26:14,114 --> 00:26:17,298
There were two babies born on that day.

343
00:26:17,298 --> 00:26:20,831
From Ms. Im Kyung Ha
and from Ms. Kim Soon Im.

344
00:26:21,845 --> 00:26:25,701
The blood we took from the infants
when they were born...

345
00:26:25,701 --> 00:26:29,269
Ms. Im Kyung Ha's baby had Type O blood,

346
00:26:29,269 --> 00:26:33,895
and Ms. Kim Soon Im's baby
had Type B blood.

347
00:26:39,189 --> 00:26:41,165
Was it O?

348
00:26:41,165 --> 00:26:44,129
Yes, according to the medical records.

349
00:26:44,129 --> 00:26:48,177
One is O, and the other is B.

350
00:26:48,177 --> 00:26:51,497
If your daughter's blood type is B,

351
00:26:51,497 --> 00:26:53,268
the baby seems to have been
switched afterward.

352
00:26:55,097 --> 00:26:57,369
- Hey!
- Please let it go.

353
00:26:57,369 --> 00:26:59,038
Please let it go. Nurse.

354
00:26:59,038 --> 00:27:00,455
Please calm down.

355
00:27:16,310 --> 00:27:17,310
Choi Sin Ae.

356
00:27:26,013 --> 00:27:28,838
Can I paint the picture
for your exhibition?

357
00:27:31,599 --> 00:27:33,814
- Why?
- Let me do it.

358
00:27:33,814 --> 00:27:35,548
You said you liked my paintings.

359
00:27:37,482 --> 00:27:38,716
Did Eun Seo ask you to do it?

360
00:27:39,146 --> 00:27:43,269
Besides, after this,
I want you to stop bullying Eun Seo.

361
00:27:44,513 --> 00:27:46,858
Stop bullying her?
Do you take me for a gangster?

362
00:27:46,858 --> 00:27:49,267
If you aren't one,
stop bothering my sister.

363
00:27:49,267 --> 00:27:51,570
If you bother her again,
I won't just let you off easy.

364
00:27:51,570 --> 00:27:54,674
But I am asking you to end this
with my painting for you.

365
00:27:54,674 --> 00:27:55,807
Do you understand?

366
00:27:57,212 --> 00:27:59,734
That's funny,
who'd like those paintings...

367
00:28:01,436 --> 00:28:05,480
Then don't you think you should ask me
rather than threaten me?

368
00:28:06,477 --> 00:28:09,016
I will think about it
if you ask me on your knees.

369
00:28:20,603 --> 00:28:21,622
Are you happy now?

370
00:28:22,562 --> 00:28:24,877
Don't bother Eun Seo from now on.

371
00:29:14,059 --> 00:29:16,532
Is there a place called
"Sun San Jib" here?

372
00:29:16,532 --> 00:29:18,653
Yes, go that way and then over there.

373
00:29:43,548 --> 00:29:44,549
Hey!

374
00:29:44,549 --> 00:29:48,269
Why are you making so much fuss
for touching your butt once?

375
00:29:50,648 --> 00:29:52,901
I will never come back here.

376
00:29:53,808 --> 00:29:55,401
Hey, you jerk!

377
00:29:55,401 --> 00:29:56,688
You rude man.

378
00:29:56,688 --> 00:29:58,665
I may be a widow,

379
00:29:58,665 --> 00:30:02,512
but my buttocks are not for a drunkard
like you to touch.

380
00:30:02,512 --> 00:30:04,130
Hey, you bastard!

381
00:30:53,538 --> 00:30:56,643
What would you like to have?
We only have hot soup with rice.

382
00:30:59,707 --> 00:31:01,771
How can I help you?

383
00:31:01,771 --> 00:31:05,444
You don't look like people
who'd have a meal in this kind of a place.

384
00:31:07,433 --> 00:31:11,388
We came here for your daughter.

385
00:31:12,434 --> 00:31:14,053
What about my daughter?

386
00:31:15,899 --> 00:31:18,058
Are you teachers from her school?

387
00:31:18,058 --> 00:31:19,842
Did she do something wrong?

388
00:31:19,842 --> 00:31:21,870
No, we are not.

389
00:31:22,873 --> 00:31:29,156
Your daughter's date of birth is
October Fourth, isn't it?

390
00:31:31,161 --> 00:31:32,540
How did you know that?

391
00:31:36,691 --> 00:31:40,829
Didn't you give birth at Ga Ram Hospital?

392
00:31:43,194 --> 00:31:45,301
Who on earth are you two?

393
00:31:46,298 --> 00:31:52,670
Can we meet your daughter?

394
00:31:54,114 --> 00:31:55,990
What is going on here?

395
00:31:57,291 --> 00:31:58,380
Honey!

396
00:31:59,794 --> 00:32:01,769
I don't want to meet her.

397
00:32:01,769 --> 00:32:03,546
I am not going to meet her ever.

398
00:32:04,688 --> 00:32:07,735
You tricked me into taking me here.

399
00:32:07,735 --> 00:32:10,600
You did not mention
we were going to meet her.

400
00:32:10,600 --> 00:32:13,376
Honey, think through it reasonably.

401
00:32:13,376 --> 00:32:16,787
What is going on?

402
00:32:17,231 --> 00:32:18,903
I will go to Eun Seo.

403
00:32:18,903 --> 00:32:20,599
Honey, why are you acting like this?

404
00:32:20,599 --> 00:32:23,150
Why are you doing this?

405
00:32:23,150 --> 00:32:25,134
Can't you hear me?

406
00:32:25,134 --> 00:32:26,822
What is it?

407
00:32:26,822 --> 00:32:29,299
What is wrong with you
coming to my house and making a fuss?

408
00:32:29,299 --> 00:32:31,652
Stop yelling. You don't know anything.

409
00:32:31,652 --> 00:32:34,196
What did you just say?

410
00:32:34,196 --> 00:32:35,797
Our children were switched.

411
00:32:35,797 --> 00:32:36,877
Honey.

412
00:32:37,884 --> 00:32:41,687
Our daughter was switched with yours.

413
00:32:43,895 --> 00:32:45,679
We came here from the hospital.

414
00:32:46,248 --> 00:32:48,545
Honey.

415
00:33:33,068 --> 00:33:34,368
Let's go to the hospital.

416
00:33:36,333 --> 00:33:38,412
Go home first.

417
00:33:38,412 --> 00:33:41,423
Go to the hospital.
Please take me to Eun Seo.

418
00:33:56,111 --> 00:34:00,018
How can you be so cruel like that?

419
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:03,699
How could you do that to me and Eun Seo?

420
00:34:16,548 --> 00:34:18,465
- What?
- You stay.

421
00:34:18,465 --> 00:34:19,812
I will go alone.

422
00:34:41,273 --> 00:34:42,277
Mom.

423
00:34:42,277 --> 00:34:43,286
Eun Seo.

424
00:34:44,524 --> 00:34:47,596
Why did you come?
I told you that you don't need to.

425
00:34:47,596 --> 00:34:48,820
It is raining.

426
00:34:48,820 --> 00:34:51,340
You are scared when it rains.

427
00:34:51,340 --> 00:34:53,403
I will protect you.

428
00:34:53,403 --> 00:34:55,965
I'm not a child.

429
00:34:56,475 --> 00:34:59,392
Are you not mom's baby anymore?

430
00:35:03,732 --> 00:35:06,134
I will keep you safe.

431
00:35:07,130 --> 00:35:09,570
So no one can touch you.

432
00:35:09,570 --> 00:35:11,685
I will protect you.

433
00:35:13,131 --> 00:35:14,131
Mom?

434
00:35:14,938 --> 00:35:19,349
Eun Seo, my daughter.

435
00:35:20,153 --> 00:35:25,322
I will watch every moment
of you growing up.

436
00:35:26,032 --> 00:35:28,489
When you go to high school,

437
00:35:28,489 --> 00:35:32,720
when you have someone you like in college,

438
00:35:32,720 --> 00:35:37,486
I will choose your wedding dress
when you get married.

439
00:35:37,486 --> 00:35:40,240
I will hold your hands
in your bridal suite.

440
00:35:41,254 --> 00:35:44,416
When you have a baby, I...

441
00:35:45,936 --> 00:35:47,057
Mom?

442
00:35:52,102 --> 00:35:55,166
Eun Seo, should we secretly order
black bean sauce noodles?

443
00:35:55,941 --> 00:35:58,382
Really? Yes.

444
00:36:07,270 --> 00:36:09,236
Hey, who is that?

445
00:36:10,704 --> 00:36:14,754
Eun Seo, Yoon Eun Seo.
She is your sister. Isn't she cute?

446
00:36:14,754 --> 00:36:16,842
Stay right here and wait for me.

447
00:36:16,842 --> 00:36:19,308
I will be right back. Good boy.

448
00:36:30,091 --> 00:36:31,825
Honey.

449
00:36:31,825 --> 00:36:33,313
Why are you up?

450
00:36:33,313 --> 00:36:35,145
- How is Eun Seo?
- She is good.

451
00:36:35,145 --> 00:36:36,302
Where is Jun Seo?

452
00:36:36,302 --> 00:36:38,910
Wait for me.
I will be back after taking some pictures.

453
00:36:53,414 --> 00:36:54,736
What?

454
00:36:54,736 --> 00:36:56,908
Kid, you can't play around here.

455
00:36:57,776 --> 00:36:59,212
You dropped them all.

456
00:36:59,212 --> 00:37:00,410
(Im Kyung Ha)

457
00:37:02,304 --> 00:37:04,139
(Kim Soon Im)

458
00:37:04,441 --> 00:37:05,441
Let's get out of here.

459
00:37:08,846 --> 00:37:10,558
Jun Seo, why are you there?

460
00:37:10,558 --> 00:37:12,055
Come here.

461
00:37:12,901 --> 00:37:17,291
Let's go.

462
00:37:35,520 --> 00:37:37,707
Your dad died.

463
00:37:40,873 --> 00:37:45,251
Poor thing, you didn't even meet your dad.

464
00:37:49,344 --> 00:37:50,467
It's fine.

465
00:37:52,104 --> 00:37:54,667
It would be better not to have
a father like that.

466
00:38:01,591 --> 00:38:05,610
Our daughter was switched with yours.

467
00:39:11,523 --> 00:39:15,293
The house was terrible.

468
00:39:18,652 --> 00:39:20,126
Her mother was, too.

469
00:39:23,738 --> 00:39:25,110
Everything is so messed up.

470
00:39:31,923 --> 00:39:32,965
I am sorry.

471
00:39:34,716 --> 00:39:35,833
I...

472
00:39:38,574 --> 00:39:40,065
Eun Seo and you,

473
00:39:43,535 --> 00:39:45,128
I love you more than anything.

474
00:39:48,255 --> 00:39:49,290
I know that.

475
00:39:50,726 --> 00:39:51,726
But,

476
00:39:54,327 --> 00:39:57,832
thinking of her living in that house...

477
00:39:59,728 --> 00:40:00,745
Honey,

478
00:40:02,286 --> 00:40:04,410
let's leave to be an exchange professor.

479
00:40:08,255 --> 00:40:12,593
Before it is too late,
before something terrible happens,

480
00:40:13,759 --> 00:40:16,550
let's go to the U.S.,
putting everything behind us,

481
00:40:16,550 --> 00:40:20,187
and live with Jun Seo and Eun Seo.

482
00:40:21,182 --> 00:40:22,417
Let's do that.

483
00:40:52,193 --> 00:40:53,284
I'm done.

484
00:40:55,426 --> 00:40:56,426
Jun Seo.

485
00:40:57,899 --> 00:40:59,858
It is so weird today.

486
00:40:59,858 --> 00:41:02,349
You and mom both.

487
00:41:03,908 --> 00:41:05,218
Do you want juice?

488
00:41:05,218 --> 00:41:06,646
Eun Seo, I'm fine.

489
00:41:13,891 --> 00:41:16,963
What is it? What's the matter?

490
00:41:19,705 --> 00:41:24,211
Would you like to know a secret?

491
00:41:24,808 --> 00:41:25,808
A secret?

492
00:41:27,721 --> 00:41:29,638
About the person I like.

493
00:41:29,638 --> 00:41:31,039
For real?

494
00:41:31,039 --> 00:41:32,307
What kind of a person is she?

495
00:41:35,366 --> 00:41:37,033
She is...

496
00:41:37,686 --> 00:41:40,734
a bit clumsy,

497
00:41:40,734 --> 00:41:42,823
stubborn,

498
00:41:42,823 --> 00:41:45,386
and messy when it comes to eating.

499
00:41:47,126 --> 00:41:48,958
So is she pretty?

500
00:41:48,958 --> 00:41:50,023
No.

501
00:41:51,276 --> 00:41:54,267
Her hair is about this long,

502
00:41:54,267 --> 00:41:56,939
and she has round eyes like yours.

503
00:41:56,939 --> 00:41:59,199
She is about your height.

504
00:41:59,199 --> 00:42:01,477
But she is so ugly.

505
00:42:01,477 --> 00:42:02,529
Ugly?

506
00:42:03,485 --> 00:42:06,543
And she is a fool.

507
00:42:06,543 --> 00:42:09,550
Even when I have been harsh on her,

508
00:42:09,550 --> 00:42:11,709
she always follows me around.

509
00:42:12,972 --> 00:42:15,220
She really bothers me.

510
00:42:15,220 --> 00:42:17,110
She can't even ride a bike well.

511
00:42:18,475 --> 00:42:20,209
That is me.

512
00:42:20,209 --> 00:42:22,108
You made me a fool.

513
00:42:22,640 --> 00:42:24,133
I'm not teasing you.

514
00:42:29,001 --> 00:42:34,580
Eun Seo, if we were not siblings,

515
00:42:35,434 --> 00:42:37,268
could we have crossed paths?

516
00:42:39,767 --> 00:42:40,767
What?

517
00:42:44,046 --> 00:42:45,869
Of course.

518
00:42:45,869 --> 00:42:49,759
We are bound by fate, a weary fate.

519
00:42:54,815 --> 00:42:57,774
All right,
let's play rock, paper, scissors.

520
00:42:57,774 --> 00:43:00,717
If you win, we are meant to be,

521
00:43:00,717 --> 00:43:02,346
and if I win, we are not.

522
00:43:02,853 --> 00:43:05,433
Okay. Wait for a second.

523
00:43:10,982 --> 00:43:11,982
No.

524
00:43:13,902 --> 00:43:15,355
Rock, paper, scissors.

525
00:43:15,997 --> 00:43:18,664
This is so strange. Why do I always lose?

526
00:43:20,278 --> 00:43:21,744
You always make a Rock.

527
00:43:23,510 --> 00:43:25,709
I am ready. Let's do it.

528
00:43:25,709 --> 00:43:27,328
Rock, paper, scissors.

529
00:43:27,838 --> 00:43:30,391
I win!

530
00:43:30,391 --> 00:43:32,073
See, I told you so.

531
00:43:32,073 --> 00:43:33,731
We are meant to be.

532
00:43:35,032 --> 00:43:36,403
Good job, my fist.

533
00:43:41,417 --> 00:43:43,747
We should tell their teachers...

534
00:43:44,720 --> 00:43:46,954
that we leave for the U.S. next month.

535
00:43:49,895 --> 00:43:50,898
Let's do that.

536
00:43:51,969 --> 00:43:53,577
I want to leave soon.

537
00:43:54,904 --> 00:43:57,098
Can you live like this?

538
00:44:01,135 --> 00:44:05,987
Don't you want to meet her once?

539
00:44:08,720 --> 00:44:09,741
No, I don't.

540
00:44:12,823 --> 00:44:14,002
You...

541
00:44:15,551 --> 00:44:17,051
No, I won't meet her.

542
00:44:17,759 --> 00:44:21,891
I don't think I can go back as it was
if I see her.

543
00:44:23,072 --> 00:44:26,306
I cannot give up Eun Seo.
I won't meet her.

544
00:44:32,232 --> 00:44:34,793
(Eun Sol Exhibition of Illustrated Poems)

545
00:44:42,791 --> 00:44:45,775
Jun Seo painted this for the student
in my class...

546
00:44:45,775 --> 00:44:48,981
who replaced Eun Seo.

547
00:44:48,981 --> 00:44:51,060
How grateful of him.

548
00:44:51,060 --> 00:44:52,830
Of course, he has to.

549
00:44:52,830 --> 00:44:54,963
I appreciate you for saying that.

550
00:44:54,963 --> 00:44:58,527
I need to do something for a moment.
Why don't you look around?

551
00:44:58,527 --> 00:44:59,927
- Yes, we will.
- See you later.

552
00:44:59,927 --> 00:45:01,193
Excuse me.

553
00:45:03,175 --> 00:45:05,704
I like the poem.

554
00:45:05,704 --> 00:45:08,290
Choi Sin Ae? Who is she?

555
00:45:08,881 --> 00:45:10,019
You don't need to know her.

556
00:45:12,784 --> 00:45:13,816
Choi Sin Ae,

557
00:45:13,816 --> 00:45:16,520
I told you about
the top student in my class.

558
00:45:16,520 --> 00:45:18,327
Is that her?

559
00:45:18,327 --> 00:45:19,467
Where is she?

560
00:45:33,876 --> 00:45:35,143
Hello.

561
00:45:35,924 --> 00:45:39,422
Is this where the exhibition
of illustrated poems is held?

562
00:45:39,422 --> 00:45:40,647
Go this way.

563
00:45:40,647 --> 00:45:42,432
This way? Thanks.

564
00:45:43,348 --> 00:45:44,352
Mom.

565
00:45:45,460 --> 00:45:46,470
Sin Ae.

566
00:45:46,972 --> 00:45:49,652
Are you out of your mind?
Why are you here?

567
00:45:49,652 --> 00:45:52,348
I came to see your illustrated poem.

568
00:45:52,348 --> 00:45:53,348
- Where is it?
- Leave now.

569
00:45:53,348 --> 00:45:54,720
What if someone were to see you?

570
00:45:54,720 --> 00:45:56,717
I don't care. I'll leave after seeing it.
I need to see yours.

571
00:45:56,717 --> 00:45:58,277
- Where is it?
- Mom.

572
00:46:37,736 --> 00:46:40,435
Hello, I am Choi Sin Ae.

573
00:46:42,970 --> 00:46:44,092
Hello.

574
00:46:44,465 --> 00:46:47,097
If Eun Seo is your daughter,
Sin Ae is your daughter, too.

575
00:46:47,097 --> 00:46:49,633
No, Sin Ae is our actual child.

576
00:46:49,633 --> 00:46:52,416
Have you ever thought about Eun Seo?

577
00:46:52,416 --> 00:46:54,306
Are you going to leave Eun Seo?

578
00:46:54,306 --> 00:46:56,442
Sin Ae is my only daughter.

579
00:46:56,442 --> 00:46:57,952
I didn't mean...

580
00:46:57,952 --> 00:47:00,771
I really wish you would disappear.

581
00:47:01,426 --> 00:47:06,893
Have you ever thought
"I wish I had a father?"

582
00:47:07,321 --> 00:47:09,098
Eun Seo's father whom we met before.

583
00:47:09,098 --> 00:47:10,769
Why did you meet him?

584
00:47:10,769 --> 00:47:12,560
I am better than Eun Seo at school,

585
00:47:12,560 --> 00:47:14,489
but she is the class president
because she has better parents!

586
00:47:14,489 --> 00:47:16,033
What am I?

587
00:47:16,033 --> 00:47:18,193
Go with your wealthy biological parents!

588
00:47:18,193 --> 00:47:19,283
Biological parents?

589
00:47:21,409 --> 00:47:23,317
Sin Ae, what is going on?

590
00:47:23,994 --> 00:47:25,044
Is that true?

591
00:47:26,383 --> 00:47:28,859
Is it true I am your daughter?

592
00:47:30,297 --> 00:47:32,452
- You and I were switched.
- Sin Ae!

593
00:47:32,452 --> 00:47:35,205
I am their daughter, not you!
